                // of class type with a user-defined `operator()` parses
                // as `Expr::Call { name: "obj", … }` (the parser's
                // primary() routes any `ident(` as a direct Call). The
                // call-site rewrite catches that case here — same shape
                // as the `Expr::CallPtr` arm below for the rarer
