                // constructor and yields a record-typed rvalue (matches
                // expr_type's Record-typed result for the same shape).
                // Allocate a result buffer the size of the record,
                // invoke `Tag::Tag(&buf, args)` via the standard ctor
                // call machinery, and leave `&buf` in RAX so the
                // enclosing record-context consumer (`Stmt::Return`,
                // member access via the gen_addr Call arm, etc.) sees
                // the buffer's address. The buffer is reclaimed by
                // `maybe_free_record_call_result` at the consumer
                // site, matching the existing record-returning-call
                // result-buffer lifecycle (Phase H2).
