                // same-named struct/class tag — `time(NULL)` is a call to the
                // `time()` function, NOT construction of `struct time` (DOS's
                // dos.h `struct time` collides with time.h's `time_t time(...)`;
                // OWL/RTL `randomize()`'s inline body `srand((unsigned)time(NULL))`
                // hit this — deferred as "class 'time' has no constructor"). Only
